{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 26, :comments ["<b>And your vows</b> — two times in the Masorah: ונדריך תשא ובאת and ונדריך תשלם. This is what we learned in the chapter [of] Nedarim: if they died or were stolen, he is liable for their guarantee, and this is ונדריך תשלם. How so ונדריך תשא? That you are liable for their guarantee until you bring them, as we say: since he said עלי, it is as one who loaded [them] onto his shoulder."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:09:36.703134612Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}